1 NOTE <p>DF</p><p><p>Notes for GEORGE (GEORGE DONIE) O'FRIEL:</p></p><p><p>Details on George and his family are provided by Eileen Carragher (his niece). He is noted in the Ballymichael School Roll as start
2 CONC ing on 4 Feb 1879 aged 6 and leaving in 1892. He does not feature in the 1901 Census, suggesting that he had left Ballymichael prior to that date. He joined the RIC, probably before his brother Franci
2 CONC s, based on his RIC No. 56288. He reputedly left the RIC in the 1920s. Elieen Carragher (Francie's daughter) recalls that he died circa 1946. She also recalls that his wife's name was Mary and that sh
2 CONC e was from Tipperary, though she did not appear to have any family. Date of birth is from the LDS site. However 1911 census indicates that Mary was born in England</p><p></p>
