1 NOTE https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/186715846/jean-m-connors  Education was important to her. She was a volunteer for Saint Clair and St. Mary's school libraries. She was past president of St. Mary's 
2 CONC Home & School Association. She was the seamstress for their band and cheerleading squad as well as a teacher's aide as needed.  Jeannie believed in doing her civic duty by holding various offices for 
2 CONC her ward's elections. In 2011 she was inducted into Pennsylvania's Voter Hall of Fame, receiving numerous commendations, for 50 years of continual voting.  She was survived be her daughter, Sandy Rudy
2 CONC , companion of Dennis Gallagher, Halifax; son, John Connors, husband of Cissy, New Brighton; daughter, Shawn Bugdanavage, wife of Wally, Pottsville; granddaughters, Sasha Reese, wife of Rick, Pittsbur
