1 NOTE <p>DF</p><p><p>Notes for FRANCIS (FRANCIE DONIE) O'FRIEL:</p></p><p><p>Francie is noted starting at Ballymichael School on  8th January 1879, aged 7 and leaving in 1889. He joined the RIC some time af
2 CONC ter his brother George. His RIC No was 56467. He left probably about 1920 and lived in Belfast. His date of birth is from the LDS site. He is in the 1911 census, living in Belfast and noted as an RIC 
2 CONC Constable- though his name is givne as Friel and not O'Friel.</p><p></p>
